  "solution": "**Given:- **\n\n12 ÷ (1/2) + {(35 ÷ 7) of 40} + 20 - 15 of 10\n\n**Concept used:- **\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47485e25d1b30c57dc271863db8b99be0c8e209069b2596cc885911d898a8a78.png] \n\n**Calculation:- **\n\n⇒ 12 ÷ (1/2) + {(35 ÷ 7) of 40} + 20 - 15 of 10 \n\n⇒ 12 ÷ (1/2) + {(5) of 40} + 20 - 15 of 10 \n\n⇒ 12 ÷ (1/2) + 5 × 40 + 20 - 150 \n\n⇒ 12 × 2 + 200 + 20 - 150 \n\n⇒ 244 - 150 = 94\n\n**∴ The required answer is __94__.**",
